  "headline": "Indonesian House Schedules Plenary Session Over Impeachment Inquiry",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesian House Moves On Impeachment Inquiry",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian House of Representatives has scheduled a plenary session to address the proposal for an inquiry into Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A total of 120 members of the House of Representatives have formally proposed an inquiry regarding Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka.",
    "The legislative body is scheduled to discuss the proposal during a plenary session held to address the submission.",
    "Some political factions are questioning the ongoing relevance of the inquiry, particularly in the event of a potential resignation."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian House of Representatives has moved forward with an official proposal for a statement of opinion, or 'Hak Menyatakan Pendapat,' concerning Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka. This legislative action follows the collection of signatures from 120 members of the House, meeting the required threshold for such an inquiry. Representatives from multiple political parties, including the National Mandate Party (PAN) and the Golkar Party, have participated in the submission. The matter has been processed through the House leadership and is set for formal discussion in an upcoming plenary session. As the process advances, some legislators, including members of the National Awakening Party (PKB), have raised questions about the continued necessity of the inquiry should the Vice President opt to resign. The House continues to review the procedural requirements for this constitutional mechanism.",
